'''Polished sulfur stairs''' are a decorative [[stairs]] variant of [[polished sulfur]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Polished Sulfur Stairs drops as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, they drop nothing.
{{Breaking row|Polished Sulfur Stairs|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

